kde-infinite-desktop (0.5.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Notes open with their Markdown source; a pencil button and Ctrl+E switch
    to the formatted text, kept per note. Right click opens the note's own
    menu everywhere. Menus and tool tips follow the color scheme.
  * Qt 6.8 or newer is required.

 -- KDE Infinite Desktop Maintainers <maintainers@kde-infinite-desktop.invalid>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0100

kde-infinite-desktop (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New features: notes with Markdown on the canvas (companion app with a
    tray icon), groups of applications that open together at their place,
    areas that grow with their windows, a map of the canvas and a canvas
    menu.

 -- KDE Infinite Desktop Maintainers <maintainers@kde-infinite-desktop.invalid>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 01:30:00 +0200

kde-infinite-desktop (0.4.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bug fix release: menus of X11 programs (Steam, Wine) in place while
    zoomed out, reliable moving of Steam, no stray clicks after submenus,
    floating panels stay floating.

 -- KDE Infinite Desktop Maintainers <maintainers@kde-infinite-desktop.invalid>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:20:00 +0200

